# survives a FIFTH species-altitude witness without new sub-predicate
# emission. The five operations discharge at this species by
# INHERITANCE from the family-root prism block plus specialisation
# through the atomic-unit-under-OBC discipline:
#
#   focus @ phrase   = attend to ONE phrase at a time; the OBC-bounded
#                      temporal envelope filters attention to the
#                      current atomic unit's ambiguity-load budget.
#   project @ phrase = down-project a bounded temporal envelope to its
#                      structural profile — the phrase's Grundgestalt
#                      or antecedent-consequent skeleton (Schenkerian
#                      reduction specialised at phrase altitude).
#   split @ phrase   = decompose an OBC-bounded phrase into finer OBC-
#                      bounded phrases at boundary events (the load-
#                      bearing `split` action at species altitude; per
#                      family-root §"Species forward-promised").
#   shift @ phrase   = advance the phrase to its next boundary event
#                      (the temporal transition between finer OBC-
#                      bounded envelopes within a joined phrase).
#   settle @ phrase  = discharge the phrase's boundary-closure event;
#                      the OBC's one-boundary-condition character
#                      completes; the ambiguity-load budget resolves;
#                      the composed cadence event fires (per Koch's
#                      `Cadenz` or Riemann's period-close discipline).
#
# The five operations discharge cleanly at phrase altitude; #S3 LANDED
# consolidates through this species (FIFTH species-altitude witness
# overall; THIRD consolidation-species witness after movement TICK 4
# and narrative TICK 5) without requiring new sub-predicate emission.
